### druid_button_style

#### \`druid_button_style.LONGTAP_TIME: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Minimum time to trigger on_hold_callback. Default: 0.4

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.AUTOHOLD_TRIGGER: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Maximum hold time to trigger button release while holding. Default: 0.8

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.DOUBLETAP_TIME: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Time between double taps. Default: 0.4

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.HOVER_SCALE: Vector3 | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Scale added on touch hover (default style). Default: <a href="/api/defold-1.14.0/vmath#vmathvector3-vector3" class="symbol-xref">vmath.vector3</a>(0.08, 0.08, 1)

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.HOVER_MOUSE_SCALE: Vector3 | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Scale added on mouse hover (default style). Default: <a href="/api/defold-1.14.0/vmath#vmathvector3-vector3" class="symbol-xref">vmath.vector3</a>(0.04, 0.04, 1)

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.HOVER_TIME: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Hover scale animation time. Default: 0.05

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.SCALE_CHANGE: Vector3 | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Scale punch on click (default style). Default: <a href="/api/defold-1.14.0/vmath#vmathvector3-vector3" class="symbol-xref">vmath.vector3</a>(0.12, 0.12, 1)

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.BTN_SOUND: string | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Sound id played on click. Default: "click"

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.BTN_SOUND_DISABLED: string | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Sound id played on disabled click. Default: "click"

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.DISABLED_COLOR: Vector4 | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Color applied when disabled via style. Default: <a href="/api/defold-1.14.0/vmath#vmathvector4-vector4" class="symbol-xref">vmath.vector4</a>(0, 0, 0, 1)

</div>

#### \`druid_button_style.ENABLED_COLOR: Vector4 | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Color applied when enabled via style. Default: <a href="/api/defold-1.14.0/vmath#vmathvector4-vector4" class="symbol-xref">vmath.vector4</a>(1)

</div>

