- <strong class="api-name">\`callback\`</strong>?: <code class="api-type">((self: unknown, custom_args: unknown, button_instance: druid_button) =&gt; void) | undefined</code> — Callback on button click
- <strong class="api-name">\`custom_args\`</strong>?: <code class="api-type">unknown | undefined</code> — Custom args for any Button event, will be passed to callbacks
- <strong class="api-name">\`anim_node\`</strong>?: <code class="api-type">Opaque&lt;&quot;node&quot;&gt; | string | undefined</code> — Node to animate instead of trigger node, useful for animating small icons on big panels

</div>

