### druid_scroll_style

#### \`druid_scroll_style.FRICT: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Multiplier for free inertion. Default: 0

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.FRICT_HOLD: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Multiplier for inertion, while touching. Default: 0

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.INERT_THRESHOLD: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Scroll speed to stop inertion. Default: 3

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.INERT_SPEED: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Multiplier for inertion speed. Default: 30

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.POINTS_DEADZONE: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Speed to check points of interests in no_inertion mode. Default: 20

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.BACK_SPEED: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Scroll back returning lerp speed. Default: 35

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.ANIM_SPEED: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Scroll gui.animation speed for scroll_to function. Default: 2

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.EXTRA_STRETCH_SIZE: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

extra size in pixels outside of scroll (stretch effect). Default: 0

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.SMALL_CONTENT_SCROLL: boolean | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

If true, content node with size less than view node size can be scrolled. Default: false

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.WHEEL_SCROLL_SPEED: number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

The scroll speed via mouse wheel scroll or touchpad. Set to 0 to disable wheel scrolling. Default: 0

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.WHEEL_SCROLL_INVERTED: boolean | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

If true, invert direction for touchpad and mouse wheel scroll. Default: false

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.WHEEL_SCROLL_BY_INERTION: boolean | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

If true, wheel will add inertion to scroll. Direct set position otherwise.. Default: false

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.ON_HOVER_CURSOR: string | number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Cursor on scroll touch hover (defos cursor), only while content is scrollable. Default: nil

</div>

#### \`druid_scroll_style.ON_MOUSE_HOVER_CURSOR: string | number | undefined\`

<div class="api-symbol-body">

Cursor on scroll mouse hover (defos cursor), only while content is scrollable. Default: nil

</div>

