- <strong class="api-name">\`cursor_index\`</strong>?: <code class="api-type">number | undefined</code> — Cursor index for cursor position, if nil - will be set to the end of the text. **0️⃣ 0-based; passed to \`druid\` unchanged.**
- <strong class="api-name">\`start_index\`</strong>?: <code class="api-type">number | undefined</code> — Start index for cursor position, if nil - will be set to the end of the text. **0️⃣ 0-based; passed to \`druid\` unchanged.**
- <strong class="api-name">\`end_index\`</strong>?: <code class="api-type">number | undefined</code> — End index for cursor position, if nil - will be set to the start_index. **0️⃣ 0-based; passed to \`druid\` unchanged.**

