- <strong class="api-name">\`value\`</strong>?: <code class="api-type">string | undefined</code> — The initial text value. Default will be <a href="/api/defold-1.14.0/gui#guiget_textnode-opaquenode-string" class="symbol-xref">gui.get_text</a>(text_node)

<p class="api-slot-label">Returns</p>

- <code class="api-type">druid_rich_text</code> — The new rich text component

</div>

#### \`druid_instance.new_rich_input(template: string, nodes?: LuaTable | undefined): druid_rich_input\`

